abstract: "Code, results and manuscript (draft v11) for an educational, advisory-only simulation study comparing demand forecasts with a standing order for platelet ordering, using public aggregate data from University Hospital Aachen (CC BY 4.0) and the Stanford pip example data. Not a clinical tool and not ordering advice."
